{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103841","id":2380448553,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6N4sMp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103841.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103841","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103841/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103841/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103841/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bf18021462005b3b93663f7cefe94d9ac0881005","number":103841,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Embed Game Window shortcut hotkeys support for `suspend/pause` and `next frame` buttons","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11948\r\n\r\nThis add shortcuts for the `suspend/pause` and `next frame` buttons inside the embed window.\r\n\r\nI've set the following default hotkeys\r\n- F9 to toggle suspend/pause\r\n- F10 to advance to next frame\r\n\r\nThey are the same hotkeys as `Breakpoint` and `Step into` hotkeys. But they don't conflict with each other due to different context focus.\r\n\r\nThe F9 hotkey is using the same convention as the breakpoint hotkey uses for macos.\r\nSo the hotkey is: `KeyModifierMask::META | KeyModifierMask::SHIFT | Key::B`\r\n\r\nI've **intentionally** let the next frame button work with is_echo() so you can hold the button to skip several frames.\r\n\r\nThis adds a very systematic way to add new shortcuts for the embed window buttons if any more buttons would like to have hotkeys. More info on the steps are inside the issue.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73452966-b5b2-4ee6-886d-6e386d4829eb\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"lo